        "<title>RapidMeta Cardiology | SGLT2-HF Ultra-Precision v12.0</title>",
        "<title>RapidMeta Vaccinology | rVSV-ZEBOV Ebola Vaccine v0.1 (STRIVE Sierra Leone + Guinea Ring, post-2014)</title>")
